{"id":"pub","lemma":"pub","pos":"noun","rank":1616,"glosses":["Television ad or advert"],"ipa":"/pyb/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pubs"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-pub.wav","examples":[{"text":"C'était un coup de pub.","en":"It was a publicity stunt.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"once, one time"]]},{"text":"Ma femme travaille dans un pub à côté.","en":"My wife works in a nearby pub.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"beside, next to"]]},{"text":"Il lorgna une fille à l'extérieur d'un pub.","en":"He ogled a girl outside a pub.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"exterior"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'est un client régulier des bars et des pubs du coin.","en":"He's a regular at the bars and pubs around here.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"customer, client"},{"g":"regular"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"bar","l":"bar"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[10,12,"local"]]},{"text":"Certains pensent que la pub est une forme de lavage de cerveaux.","en":"Some people think that advertising is a form of brainwashing.","words":[{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"washing"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"brain","l":"cerveau"}]}]}